      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A deceptively spacious red-brick residence occupying a prime position on Harold's Cross Road, just moments from Terenure Village. Offering generous proportions throughout, No. 305 presents a rare opportunity to acquire a home with exceptional potential and the perfect blank canvas upon which to create a bespoke family home.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is well balanced and highly versatile, providing excellent scope to modernise, remodel or extend, subject to the necessary planning permission. Whether seeking to create a contemporary family home or a stylish urban residence, the foundations are firmly in place for a purchaser to realise their own vision. The accommodation comprises hall, living room, dining, sitting room, kitchen/breakfast room, bathroom and bedroom. On first floor there are 3 bedrooms and a bathroom and the attic is also converted. \r\n\r\nThe location is second to none, with Terenure Village, Bushy Park, excellent schools, cafés, restaurants and transport links all within easy reach. Combining space, potential and convenience, No. 305 offers an exciting opportunity in one of Dublin's most established residential settings."
      },
